{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PISO 6</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game that combines narrative exploration with puzzle solving across two timelines: <strong>past</strong> and <strong>present</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY\u00a0</strong><br>After his father's death, Tom\u00e1s Vega returns to his childhood apartment searching for a will. But as soon as he steps through the door of 6D, time starts to behave strangely, and memories begin to seep through the walls.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/3d3297c42cc7c9d905383b3b09c91ea6.poster.avif?t=1756939882\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/3d3297c42cc7c9d905383b3b09c91ea6.webm?t=1756939882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/3d3297c42cc7c9d905383b3b09c91ea6.mp4?t=1756939882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Through a core mechanic called <i><strong>Recall</strong></i>, the player will travel to the past and experience the pure nostalgia of the 90s and early 2000s in Argentina. <br>Every object is carefully designed to trigger that feeling of nostalgia in the player, but not all memories are pleasant.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/bf147f3fe4dbdef3ab9563ad1b37f3be.poster.avif?t=1756939882\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/bf147f3fe4dbdef3ab9563ad1b37f3be.webm?t=1756939882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/bf147f3fe4dbdef3ab9563ad1b37f3be.mp4?t=1756939882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By pressing \u201cR\u201d to recall, the player can switch between past and present to solve environmental puzzles, access new areas, and piece together a story marked by abandonment, fear, and guilt. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/5b11dde96e5da8e6c2fbc4abc70c9896.poster.avif?t=1756939882\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/5b11dde96e5da8e6c2fbc4abc70c9896.webm?t=1756939882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/5b11dde96e5da8e6c2fbc4abc70c9896.mp4?t=1756939882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Inspired by classic survival horror games from the PS1 era, PISO 6 offers a brief but intense experience without combat, where every object, every sound, and every shadow are clues to a past that might be better left buried.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919710?t=1756939882","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/9693ae14b2b32b0fca9d4cc8ced9611788d703bd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756939882","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/883bbe87f1c89d8396985dee82b349e3d6efcce6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756939882","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/883bbe87f1c89d8396985dee82b349e3d6efcce6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756939882","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3980610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PISO 6</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game that combines narrative exploration with puzzle solving across two timelines: <strong>past</strong> and <strong>present</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY\u00a0</strong><br>After his father's death, Tom\u00e1s Vega returns to his childhood apartment searching for a will. But as soon as he steps through the door of 6D, time starts to behave strangely, and memories begin to seep through the walls.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/3d3297c42cc7c9d905383b3b09c91ea6.poster.avif?t=1756939882\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/3d3297c42cc7c9d905383b3b09c91ea6.webm?t=1756939882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/3d3297c42cc7c9d905383b3b09c91ea6.mp4?t=1756939882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Through a core mechanic called <i><strong>Recall</strong></i>, the player will travel to the past and experience the pure nostalgia of the 90s and early 2000s in Argentina. <br>Every object is carefully designed to trigger that feeling of nostalgia in the player, but not all memories are pleasant.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/bf147f3fe4dbdef3ab9563ad1b37f3be.poster.avif?t=1756939882\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/bf147f3fe4dbdef3ab9563ad1b37f3be.webm?t=1756939882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/bf147f3fe4dbdef3ab9563ad1b37f3be.mp4?t=1756939882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By pressing \u201cR\u201d to recall, the player can switch between past and present to solve environmental puzzles, access new areas, and piece together a story marked by abandonment, fear, and guilt. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/5b11dde96e5da8e6c2fbc4abc70c9896.poster.avif?t=1756939882\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/5b11dde96e5da8e6c2fbc4abc70c9896.webm?t=1756939882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/extras/5b11dde96e5da8e6c2fbc4abc70c9896.mp4?t=1756939882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Inspired by classic survival horror games from the PS1 era, PISO 6 offers a brief but intense experience without combat, where every object, every sound, and every shadow are clues to a past that might be better left buried.</p>","developers":["NostalgyStudios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919710/91d48bd84ddd04dfc5aaad95643d78d12020ae14/header.jpg?t=1756939882","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any up-to-date distribution<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 or AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card compatible with OpenGL 4.5 / Vulkan, 2GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Compatible with ALSA or PulseAudio<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> libc6, libstdc++, libgl1-mesa-glx</li><